---
// Hero Section for Renova TMS Placeholder
---
<span id="top"></span>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 id="hero-heading">Targeted brain stimulation. Opening soon in Surrey Hills.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Renova TMS is a new transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS) clinic being established in Melbourne&rsquo;s inner east. We are building a targeted, measurement-based service with a research-minded culture, and we will open once our founding clinical team is in place.
      </p>
      <div class="notice" role="status">
        <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        We are not yet accepting patients or referrals.
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#register" class="btn btn-primary">Register your interest</a>
        <a href="#join" class="btn btn-ghost">Join the founding team</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="hero-card-art">
          <img
            src="/images/hero/targeted-neuro-resonance.webp"
            alt="Abstract targeted neurological resonance artwork for Renova TMS"
            width="1376"
            height="768"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card-body">
          <div class="hero-card-badge">
            <span class="badge-dot"></span>
            Clinical Practice Notice
          </div>
          <div class="hero-card-title">Renova TMS &middot; Surrey Hills</div>
          <p class="hero-card-desc">
            Establishing a dedicated neurostimulation service co-located alongside an established neurosurgical practice in Melbourne&rsquo;s inner east.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-card-stats">
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="stat-label">Model</span>
              <span class="stat-val">Targeted &amp; Measured</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="stat-label">Clinical Oversight</span>
              <span class="stat-val">Psychiatrist-Led</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="stat-label">Current Stage</span>
              <span class="stat-val">Founding Team Setup</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
